<title>USA: Action Performance Q3 June 30 shr down.</title>
<headline>Action Performance Q3 June 30 shr down.</headline>
<dateline>TEMPE, Ariz. 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Action Performance Cos Inc</p>
<p>				    Q3		     Nine Months</p>
<p>			   1997	 1996	  1997	  1996</p>
<p> Sales	 $ 39,631,501$ 12,282,627$ 83,109,179 $30,054,859</p>
<p> Gross profit  14,683,866   5,424,382  31,859,890  12,612,852</p>
<p>Non-recurring</p>
<p>charge for</p>
<p>litigation</p>
<p>  settlement  (5,400,000)	    --  (5,400,000)	   --</p>
<p> Net income     1,098,026   1,776,692   5,103,191   3,794,364</p>
<p>Earnings per</p>
<p>fully diluted</p>
<p>  share		  0.08	  0.14	  0.36	  0.29</p>
<p>Weighted average</p>
<p>number of fully</p>
<p>diluted shares</p>
<p>outstanding  14,430,317  13,150,125  14,033,328  13,053,925</p>
<p>NOTE: Including the previously announced one-time charge of $4.9 million for the API settlement agreement reached in June, as well as the associated legal fees totalling $0.5 million for that litigation, net income for the third quarter was $1.1 million, or $0.08 per share.</p>
<p>Q3 net income, excluding API settlement charges, more than doubled, to $4.3 million, or $0.30 per fully diluted share vs $1.8 million, or $0.14 per share.</p>
